  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bfcb709b487afd749b8fbd2c4c50e261, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tinkerer
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Key: Tinkerer
  Label: Tinkerer
  Blurb: Solves most problems with something she brought, and the rest with something
    she makes.
  Vision:
    Fantasy: 'A hero that solves almost everything with tools and steam-punk style
      of abilities. '
    Role: Support and damage dealer mainly
    SignatureMechanic: 'Can dissassemble ''mechanical'' enemies. Similar to how rikku
      can do it in FFX. Dissassemble is achieved in the root of the sphere grid.
      It has a % success rate, which becomes bigger the more often you have defeated
      that specific enemy. '
    UltraStyle: Assemble Mech. Mount a mech, so the tinkerer jumps onto its body.
      The tinkerer basically gets a 'shield', and the mech body also has its own
      actions. Both tinkerer and mech can act. When the tinkerer summons, the mech
      can directly act after. the tinkerer's turn is spent. The next turn cycle,
      tinkerer and mech should come one after the other (they share the same agility
      for turns)
    Ultras:
    - Name: Warior Mech
      Effect: A warrior-type mech with offensive abilities
      Unlock: a
    - Name: Oil Spewing Mech
      Effect: A mech that focusses on debuffing the enemy. All its attacks inflict
        oil
      Unlock: b
    - Name: Flamethrower Mech
      Effect: Ranged-type mech that focusses primarlly on fire-type attacks.
      Unlock: c
    Branches: []
    Overlaps: x
    OpenQuestions: 'Not a question, but a todo: Unit types. E.g. undead, mechnanical,
      flying etc. These tags are needed for the tinkerer to disassemble enemies. '
